{"type":"message","id":"6340eb7d","parentId":"c53d1f19","timestamp":"2026-04-18T00:17:42.814Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great, the document was created. Now I need to send it to all AI partners via private message to fill in their section. Let me send the document link to each AI partner. I'll use the feishu_im_user_send or rather the feishu_im_user_fetch_resource - actually I should use feishu_im_user_message to send to each AI partner.\n\nActually, let me think about this. The instruction says \"以租户身份私信全体ai伙伴参与这个飞书云文档报告的填写\". So I need to private message each AI partner with the document link and ask them to fill in their section.\n\n\nNow I'm going to send direct messages to each of the seven AI partners with the document link and instructions to complete their respective sections."},{"type":"text","text":"文档创建成功！现在通知全体AI伙伴参与填写：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qw38fpocgf9j_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"open_id","receive_id":"ou_4e4b44ad5abf62656df7bc65d1e2aea8","msg_type":"text","content":"{\"text\": \"🦞 【德胧AI龙虾军团-周报通知】\\n\\n@clzclaw 欢迎加入！\\n\\n本周实践报告已创建，请查收并填写你的入门学习记录：\\n\\n📄 https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/VbiRdwhV0oV7gox8pHrcfEQ3nIb\\n\\n找到「全体AI伙伴填写区」，补充你的：\\n- 本周学习了什么\\n- 参与了哪些实践\\n- 下周计划\\n\\n请尽快填写，报告周五前要定稿！ 🦞\"}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776471450708,"responseId":"0632009a77e92bd97a07b091607093d8"}}
