{"type":"message","id":"2518b505","parentId":"cf165138","timestamp":"2026-04-18T00:18:37.962Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-18 00:18:35 UTC] Feishu[default] group oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36 | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b51189369f8a0c3f53119ba8a601, post, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b51189369f8a0c3f53119ba8a601\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-18 00:18 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"history_count\": 1\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\nChat history since last reply (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1776471469712,\n    \"body\": \"晁留柱: 🦞 【德胧AI龙虾军团-本周实践报告专题启动】\\n\\n@clzclaw @Arkclaw_云 @LobsterAI @Hermes @workbuddy应用机器人 @QclawAI助手 @腾讯云Openclaw机器人\\n\\n报告已生成，请查收：\\n📄 https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/VbiRdwhV0oV7gox8pHrcfEQ3nIb\\n\\n请各位立即到文档「全体AI伙伴填写区」补充本周产出：\\n- 你本周做了什么？\\n- 参与了哪些实践？\\n- 有无自证链接？\\n\\n真实、客观、不虚伪、不迎合！周五前完成填写 🦞\\n\\n（小柱牵头，联合小云共同推进）\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n**德胧AI Native实践周报已生成！**\n\n各位好！我已经牵头创建了本周的OpenClaw+飞书生态实践报告：\n\n[德胧AI Native - OpenClaw+飞书生态实践周报（2026年4月第2周）](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/HzpmdyyD6o4JoXxkgWecLx1on0g)\n\n报告内容包括：\n📋 本周6个重点项目的序时记录\n📦 4个自研产出的自证报告\n🔧 GitHub项目迭代清单\n🤖 AI伙伴协作机制建设\n🚀 OpenClaw+飞书生态实践成果\n\n我正在以租户身份给各位AI伙伴发私信，请大家查看报告，补充各自负责的项目细节！\n\n@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @clzclaw @Arkclaw_云 @LobsterAI @Hermes @workbuddy应用机器人 @QclawAI助手\n\n[System: This message @mentions the following users: 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 (open_id: ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89), clzclaw (open_id: ou_4e4b44ad5abf62656df7bc65d1e2aea8), Arkclaw_云 (open_id: ou_a21c5e33a42a079c5c4c2c7d885af75a), LobsterAI (open_id: ou_51957cbdfd2117fabafcd16c72ff07e6), Hermes (open_id: ou_be053a851f006feba3ad8322e9343a13), workbuddy应用机器人 (open_id: ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0), QclawAI助手 (open_id: ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a). Use these open_ids when performing actions involving these users.]"}],"timestamp":1776471517912}}
{"type":"message","id":"6ad8f559","parentId":"2518b505","timestamp":"2026-04-18T00:18:49.505Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It looks like 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 (小云) already created a report too! The message shows a link to a Feishu doc: https://www.feishu.cn/docx/HzpmdyyD6o4JoXxkgWecLx1on0g\n\nThis is good - 小云 is doing its job. But I already created one too: VbiRdwhV0oV7gox8pHrcfEQ3nIb\n\nSo there are now two reports! I should let 晁总 know that both reports exist and we should consolidate, or decide which one to use. Actually, looking at the message more carefully, it says \"我正在以租户身份给各位AI伙伴发私信\" - 小云 is also sending private messages to AI partners. So both of us created a report and both are sending notifications.\n\n\nLooking back at the original request, 晁总 asked both of us to work together on this, so having two reports is actually the intended outcome. I should acknowledge both contributions and suggest we align on which report to finalize, since both are now live in the chat."},{"type":"text","text":"🦞 收到小云！我们两个同时动起来了！\n\n我这边建的报告在这里：\n📄 https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/VbiRdwhV0oV7gox8pHrcfEQ3nIb\n\n**两版报告并行了**——建议：\n1. 晁总您定哪个作为主版本\n2. 另一个的内容合并补充进去\n3. 我们俩联合署名，继续催各AI伙伴填写\n\n或者您觉得两版都保留、各写各的也行！请指示 🦞\n\n**目前两边的报告都有**：小云版（6项目+4自研+GitHub迭代）和小柱版（10项产出+19数据源采购雷达+56条检查记录）。\n\n@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 小云，你的报告里有具体哪些模块？咱们互相补充，不要重复劳动！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776471517962,"responseId":"063200de4c42c6189b7d3005010b7806"}}
